Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.78,0:00:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.20,0:00:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.96,0:00:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.66,0:00:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.52,0:00:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.32,0:00:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a monster deep within\Nyour dreams, taking aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,for your heart so it would\Nseem Stand tall and read,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.76,0:00:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,go to hell and jump for\Nparadise Every time dangerous,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.90,0:00:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,dangerous We like it serious, serious,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.28,0:00:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,oh Looking deep in the dream\Nthere is the one in pain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.66,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out that's the one who\Nmeans the most to you today
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.06,0:00:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Adventure calls now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.94,0:00:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,let's go The balls filled between us, they\Nwill show Still what we don't know Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.72,0:01:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,working hard together Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.38,0:01:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got superpowers. Got to dream\Ndespite the rivalry. Gotta see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.82,0:01:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It through believing in you.\NThere's even charm in failure. Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.32,0:01:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,we've got superpowers
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.48,0:01:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All the love and the tears\Nin the world we're in
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.10,0:01:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,United gently bringing\Nup our thought again,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.70,0:01:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're the foolish ones.\NWe love, we'll carry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.56,0:01:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Till we see the light, the sun will rise
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.24,0:01:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The greatest fight at its core is\Nagainst myself forevermore Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.68,0:01:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,let's do it now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.62,0:01:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go. The bonds built between us,\Nthey will show. So what we don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.86,0:01:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,that's what we call adventure Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.22,0:01:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,we've got superpowers Got to dream\Ndespite the rivalry Gotta see
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.64,0:02:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It through believing in you.\NThere's even charm in failure. Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.02,0:02:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,we've got superpowers Superpowers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.34,0:02:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.16,0:02:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,we've got superpowers\NSuperpowers Superpowers Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.56,0:02:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the Super Bowers. Super Bowers. Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.96,0:02:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,we're the Super Bowers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.02,0:02:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no idea how dead you are
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.14,0:02:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.82,0:02:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, master. How may I\Nassist you? Hunt down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.58,0:02:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,that furry punk and drop her to pieces
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.76,0:03:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll carve it into your bones. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.60,0:03:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you mean well, sir, but I'm\Nafraid that you're going to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.38,0:03:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like you, Tia,\Nneed to work on your aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.24,0:03:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That I shall! Come this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.00,0:03:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Like the pain in the ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.70,0:03:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sneaky wine, hurry! Switch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.82,0:03:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.52,0:03:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.12,0:03:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You sneaky rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.56,0:03:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she gonna steal every wheel we've got?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.70,0:03:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you think this is\Nreal funny, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.58,0:03:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,She's too fast and the enemy is destroying\Ntheir own fleet trying to catch her!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.30,0:04:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We're lucky we have her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.50,0:04:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's awesome, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.94,0:04:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Karen is like a little sister to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.20,0:04:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,When the weather and moon cycles\Nalign, minks are quite strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.74,0:04:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And with proper training,\Nthey're unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.54,0:04:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean the full moon lets\Nher do all that stuff? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.16,0:04:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,As the story goes, on a clear night,\Nif the minks gaze up at a full moon,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.02,0:04:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,they call forth the primal memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.34,0:04:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,buried deep within their subconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.86,0:04:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,People refer to this pure,\Nwhite, ferocious form as Sulong,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.78,0:04:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,or Moonlion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.30,0:04:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Moonlion?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.21,0:04:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But the transformation may\Ncause them to lose control.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.40,0:04:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If they cannot maintain\Ntheir sense of self,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.72,0:04:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,they'll lash out at friend and foe alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.02,0:04:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And it can spell their own end as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.70,0:04:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean the transformation drains\Ntheir life force or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.60,0:04:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Not exactly,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.70,0:04:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,but if they continue to\Nfight all through the night,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.06,0:04:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,their body just won't be able to take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.24,0:05:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll surely die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.54,0:05:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.45,0:05:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.37,0:05:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A double-edged sword, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.14,0:05:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The sort of technique one would only\Nuse in a life-or-death struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.90,0:05:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, it was wise of Garrett to\Nsteal the wheels and avoid direct combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.48,0:05:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall back her up to settle\Nthis as quickly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.02,0:05:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,before she can harm herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.20,0:05:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How will you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.66,0:05:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to fall into the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.94,0:05:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Worry not, friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.88,0:05:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.56,0:05:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He's light enough to\Nrun on top of the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.96,0:05:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He is just bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.12,0:05:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have faith that they'll\Nsecure the route for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.86,0:05:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing we can do but keep\Nmoving forward at full speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.02,0:05:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.93,0:05:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Not stopping, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.16,0:06:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Dunge to the left!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.74,0:06:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,To the right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, stop, D. D.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.62,0:06:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Prometheus, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.00,0:06:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.22,0:06:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Press!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.24,0:06:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama's acting strange!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.16,0:06:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.82,0:06:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, she's lost a lickety lot of\Nweight and her breathing is irregular.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.28,0:07:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Prometheus, Zeus...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.62,0:07:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Napoleon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.53,0:07:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to Prometheus and Zeus?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.88,0:07:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll call them over right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.60,0:07:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,At this point, her hunger\Npangs have lasted eight hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.90,0:07:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely, this is her lickety\Nlongest rampage ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.14,0:07:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's more than a craving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.72,0:07:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's starvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.78,0:07:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Even as her eldest son, I've\Nnever seen anything like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.90,0:07:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's uncharted territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.00,0:07:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama has become a lickety\Nbeast, a brand new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.84,0:07:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we even make it to Kakau Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.18,0:07:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Briss, I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.54,0:07:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a call saying the pudding is\Non our way with the cake as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.36,0:07:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They wanted to meet us at\Nsea. What? That's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.54,0:07:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,She can save our lickety lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.14,0:07:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there is one\Nproblem: pudding is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.24,0:08:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And she does have the wedding cake, but\Nthe ship she's on belongs to veggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.50,0:08:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on—you're kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.40,0:08:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell would that\Ngoon have the cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.60,0:08:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He tried to murder mama—that's insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.62,0:08:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know—that's kind\Nof lickety essential we.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.88,0:08:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,lickety essential we I can't\Npossibly trust that cake anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.42,0:08:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be poisoned for certain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.72,0:08:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to pull here, punk?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.00,0:08:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's my line!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.36,0:08:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you dense?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.78,0:08:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep your damn poison away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.20,0:08:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Every single chef here made\Nthat wedding cake with pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.20,0:08:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Think I care?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.36,0:08:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom is going to eat\Nthat cake without a doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.08,0:08:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing that, you'd have to be a\Nreal bozo not to fill it with poison,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.54,0:09:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,or explosives at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.78,0:09:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a rare chance\Nto take out an emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.08,0:09:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're about to blow it over this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.28,0:09:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Some piddly bullcrap?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.14,0:09:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Bullcrap?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.05,0:09:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We put our pride of chefs\Non the line, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.24,0:09:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So screw your backstabbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.36,0:09:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll win this fight with flavor alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.58,0:09:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Kid, your head is way up\Nin the clouds. Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.18,0:09:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom's had all kinds\Nof delicious desserts
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.38,0:09:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,from every corner of the whole damn sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.38,0:09:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think you're gonna impress\Nher when she lives in a country of cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.90,0:09:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Get real!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.22,0:09:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.14,0:09:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that much, and if\Nwe fail, then we're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.68,0:09:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I say bring it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.84,0:09:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if she likes the cake, that doesn't\Nmean she's gonna let us walk away alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.26,0:09:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we'll see after she eats it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.64,0:09:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to wait for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.14,0:09:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I would know\Nbetter than you, jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.82,0:09:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.88,0:09:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't kill big mom now, you\Nwon't live long enough to regret it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.88,0:09:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, uh... Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.80,0:09:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama... Mama...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.64,0:10:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.30,0:10:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,MOTHER!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.82,0:10:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do to him, Blackleg?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.98,0:10:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They're talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.22,0:10:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.64,0:10:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what in the hell did\Nyou shove in his mouth, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.50,0:10:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.24,0:10:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, uh-huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.02,0:10:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Feels like I've gone to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.30,0:10:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This cream is to die for. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.50,0:10:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You nearly died from flavor.\NWhatever. You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.88,0:10:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the deal. Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.60,0:10:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Assassinate whoever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.24,0:10:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait until my guest has been\Nserved and the meal is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.92,0:10:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If someone is hungry, then I feed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.76,0:10:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That is my duty as a chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.00,0:11:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Pudding? Why are\Nyou collapsing, sweetie?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.94,0:11:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I have poured every ounce of my\Ncooking abilities into this cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.76,0:11:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, it'll knock her out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.40,0:11:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.28,0:11:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That was real screwy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.46,0:11:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I was hypnotized.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.30,0:11:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, maybe it'll\Nknock Big Mom out, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.98,0:11:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you say, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.48,0:11:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's hurry. You finish coating\Nthe cake yet a little bit more to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.64,0:11:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh lady chiffon two chefs fell\Nvictim to the delicious smell,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.36,0:11:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,damn it—keep your wits\Nabout you till it's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.56,0:11:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am, I'm on my way, nami,\Nstay safe till we're together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.14,0:11:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,again
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.46,0:11:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee whiz, this is taking forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.34,0:11:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Which way? Straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.04,0:11:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Napoleon's signal, it's getting stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.68,0:11:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.59,0:12:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,this wouldn't have happened if you didn't\Nneed to go back and eat all that fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.96,0:12:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I needed that fire, because you\Nhurt me, you traitor. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.58,0:12:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure are soft on that Straw Hat lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.64,0:12:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the real deal, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.82,0:12:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The two of us are homies\Nmade for Mama's soul itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.00,0:12:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing that, your\Nbetrayal is unforgivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.26,0:12:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So straighten the hell up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.56,0:12:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I will, but I'm telling you, those\Nthunderclouds were incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.20,0:12:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you even have an ounce of regret?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.58,0:12:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't steer the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.68,0:12:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We're drifting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.14,0:12:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a path opening up. Break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.04,0:12:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This could be our chance.\NWow. Thanks, Carrot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.24,0:12:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You ready, Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.26,0:12:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to fight to defend\Nthis ship at all costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.26,0:12:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.30,0:12:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.21,0:12:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,They're coming back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.68,0:12:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.06,0:13:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.92,0:13:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That didn't work, Carrot! Bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.40,0:13:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh, can skeletons\Nnormally run out of water?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.48,0:13:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares? Shoot him! It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.44,0:13:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I must do my part.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.66,0:13:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.58,0:13:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't wrap this up soon, I'm gonna\Npass out. How many ships are left?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.88,0:13:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Not you, you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.00,0:13:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Blade split!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.98,0:14:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That saved me some work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.94,0:14:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, one more try.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.22,0:14:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.02,0:14:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Carrot, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.04,0:14:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,V. R. T.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.16,0:14:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now die, you old rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.76,0:14:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave it my best, Pedro.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.30,0:14:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I think this is it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.90,0:15:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a barren corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.44,0:15:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.44,0:15:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ashamed to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.92,0:15:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,All I could do is put\None ship's crew to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.16,0:15:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You are amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.08,0:15:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.24,0:15:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You, dear, saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.52,0:15:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And you saved us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.58,0:15:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how do you turn back?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.16,0:15:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is shade\Nmy eyes from the moonlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.54,0:15:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't take much, just a hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.50,0:15:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Closing my eyes does it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.80,0:15:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The light of the full moon\Nreally is magic for us minx.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.38,0:15:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It was rather enchanting to be home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.36,0:15:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad you're back. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.04,0:15:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.20,0:15:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.62,0:15:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Without you, we'd be sunk. No question.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.62,0:15:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship was totally surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.54,0:16:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, even I didn't have a good plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.22,0:16:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just happy to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.24,0:16:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I stay in the room\Nwith no moonlight, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.10,0:16:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.86,0:16:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax and leave the rest to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.52,0:16:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You were awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.08,0:16:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Press!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.28,0:16:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Daifuku's fleet is drifting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.42,0:16:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think he'll be\Nable to help us anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.12,0:16:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So useless, lickety lame brain!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.80,0:16:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama looks like she's\Non her last lickety leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.42,0:16:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.82,0:16:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I promised, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.78,0:16:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Tommy, may I ask? Yeah! Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.24,0:16:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, is that Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.94,0:16:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,She's light and fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.28,0:16:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,She burned a lot of fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.64,0:17:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, it's been ages
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.20,0:17:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,since I've seen Mama with moves like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.30,0:17:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me the wedding cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.62,0:17:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Big Bob! She's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.08,0:17:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Napoleon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.50,0:17:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Transform into a sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.76,0:17:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.04,0:17:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.04,0:17:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm real
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.66,0:17:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.12,0:18:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.34,0:18:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,She got even scarier!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.02,0:18:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this new form?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.34,0:18:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My cake, where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.68,0:18:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.20,0:18:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourselves. Stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.84,0:18:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We might have to abandon ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.78,0:18:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.70,0:18:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so hungry. I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.08,0:18:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Only one thing can satisfy me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.92,0:18:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I need cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.52,0:18:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.68,0:18:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell is my damn wedding cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.58,0:19:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't suppose we\Ncould ask her to vacate?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.78,0:19:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That startled me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.50,0:19:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.88,0:19:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If he keeps this up, we won't have a\Nsingle mirror left in the whole Tang town.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.06,0:19:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knew he could stand up to\NGeneral Katakuri for so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.20,0:19:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We keep getting reports of mirrors\Nbreaking from across Tutuland.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.64,0:19:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sacrebleu! It is already half past Nif.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.46,0:19:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been almost 12 hours since\Nthe attack on the tea party.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.18,0:19:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I would appreciate some kind of update.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.30,0:20:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention, please, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.16,0:20:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I might have some\Ninteresting info for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.86,0:20:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't spoil it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.10,0:20:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're ruining the Straw\NHat's chances of survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.54,0:20:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, Mademoiselle Stussy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.42,0:20:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you recall how Linlin was\Nflaunting the Tamate Box?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.16,0:20:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,the treasure from the Ryugu Palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.28,0:20:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, is it true that Straw\NHat Luffy gifted it to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.00,0:20:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And why do you mention this, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.30,0:20:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to hear a funny story?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.90,0:20:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That box was the cause of the blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.02,0:20:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you are just being absurd!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.74,0:20:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, just look at him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.56,0:20:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.64,0:20:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You kick his butt good, big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.22,0:20:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the holdup?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.76,0:20:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there a problem? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.10,0:20:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm just doing my damnedest\Nnot to get noticed by him, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.76,0:20:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The little creep won't hold still, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.82,0:20:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.94,0:21:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.40,0:21:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Lame excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.31,0:21:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.04,0:21:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that Big Bro\NKadakuri's got this and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.26,0:21:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure wish we could help him in some way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.14,0:21:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys, do you know who's gonna\Nget some head pats from Big Brew? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.56,0:21:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.47,0:21:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.74,0:21:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you, Lady Floppe!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.86,0:21:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Good answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.92,0:21:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a total of 41 older brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.70,0:21:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,During the Best Little\NSister Awards ceremony,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.44,0:21:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,a whopping 40 of them voted for Sweet Omi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.20,0:21:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I won!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.72,0:21:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't love me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.90,0:21:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.18,0:21:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an honor to be everybody's favorite!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.84,0:21:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be king of the Little Sisters!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.16,0:21:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.52,0:22:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone is dying to get some\Nattention from my beloved big brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.24,0:22:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't really blame them, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.76,0:22:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.70,0:22:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Even all my other siblings, brothers\Nincluded, won a piece of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.44,0:22:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I have far too many\Nrivals for his affection.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.58,0:22:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hardly even fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.22,0:22:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can somehow figure out a way to help\Nhim, I'll score some points for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.34,0:22:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel that on an emotional level.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.28,0:22:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We would love to get into General\NKatakuri's good graces as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.62,0:22:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard me, I called\Ndibs, get lost already.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.58,0:22:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew there was trouble when he got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.80,0:22:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't seem like himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.70,0:22:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But now he's back to maximum coolness!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.50,0:22:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.52,0:22:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,despite that, I really do despise to see\Nhim struggle this much against an enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.58,0:22:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He must embody total perfection at\Nall times, or it'll disappoint me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.14,0:22:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,True, true.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.04,0:22:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.84,0:23:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe struggle is too harsh of a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.20,0:23:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This other guy's really\Nhanging in there is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.38,0:23:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time General Katakuri\Nknocks him on his ass,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.54,0:23:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,he gets back up for a second helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.28,0:23:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.88,0:23:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you hiding my wedding cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.24,0:23:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see if you rotten\Nbrats put it under here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.54,0:23:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We do not have what you seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.58,0:23:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.88,0:23:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It has to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.42,0:23:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe in our word.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.96,0:23:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You shall not find any\Ncake aboard this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.80,0:24:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.04,0:24:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.38,0:24:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just hiding it from me! Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.70,0:24:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My eldest son told me that it's here,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.98,0:24:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and he surely knows better than to lie to\Nhis dear old mother, because if he did,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.28,0:24:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd murder him with my own two hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.38,0:24:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hoping she wouldn't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.26,0:24:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are lying, you'll pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.60,0:24:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think I won't\Ntake your lifespan, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.14,0:24:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,She's actually aware of what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.12,0:24:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought she was lost in a daze!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.32,0:24:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I was sure that I could lickety-trick her!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.42,0:24:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got some nerve accusing my\Nson of being a dirty, rotten liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.48,0:24:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Napoleon!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.08,0:24:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up, Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.24,0:24:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Cognac!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.08,0:25:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.72,0:25:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll slice you into\Ntwo and set you ablaze!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.84,0:25:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Flaming sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.24,0:25:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from her, Jinbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.60,0:25:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.56,0:25:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Corgi, glaze! Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.96,0:25:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.58,0:25:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she blocking a swing from Cognac?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.68,0:25:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost feel sorry for you, Shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.52,0:25:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're overestimating your power!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.58,0:25:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Team Bay! Is he okay? Team Bay!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.18,0:25:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma-ma-ma-ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.22,0:26:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm withering away over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.10,0:26:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.30,0:26:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it to me already!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.56,0:26:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Kara, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.42,0:26:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.18,0:26:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave that room alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.02,0:26:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stop on one condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.80,0:26:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Fork over my cage!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.22,0:26:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Nani!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.74,0:26:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.56,0:26:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.66,0:26:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The sail caught fire from Big Mom's hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.82,0:26:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Our dear ship is burning!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.30,0:26:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just mess up already! Run, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.66,0:26:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I want my cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.40,0:26:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Guard Point!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.96,0:27:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.84,0:27:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look at you, little guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.28,0:27:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're even stranger than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.66,0:27:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to add you to my\Ncollection of rare creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.02,0:27:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be the plumpest\Nlittle raccoon I ever saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.38,0:27:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a stinking raccoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.64,0:27:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a reindeer, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.56,0:27:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,After I get my wedding cake, I'll find a\Nspecial place for both you and Soul King.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.24,0:27:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.78,0:27:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have your dumb cake,\Nand I'm not your play thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.26,0:27:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Duffer!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.80,0:27:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, if the ship sinks, maybe my\Nlickety-ly will go down with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.00,0:27:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I call lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.56,0:27:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, if that thing goes up in smoke,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.64,0:27:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,our annoying vermin problem\Nwill take care of itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.42,0:27:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.64,0:27:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship! The ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.60,0:27:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's burning up!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.34,0:28:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.44,0:28:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he attempt to dodge?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.48,0:28:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you knocked out?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.88,0:28:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you still have\Nthat glimmer in your eye?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.30,0:29:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Falling is shameful enough in itself, but\Nyou keep getting back up to do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.76,0:29:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, a ship, a ship, it's burning up!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.00,0:30:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, are you gonna mess up and tell me\Nwhere the wedding cake is hidden or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.64,0:30:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go! Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.48,0:30:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.82,0:30:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to put out the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.16,0:30:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.07,0:30:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Water! Water!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.99,0:30:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We need water!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.54,0:30:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ocean current!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.52,0:30:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Soldier throw!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.58,0:30:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.46,0:30:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.42,0:30:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.58,0:30:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch, ouch, ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.42,0:31:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn that guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.68,0:31:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that water really drenched me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.26,0:31:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Jimmy!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.44,0:31:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.96,0:31:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your final warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.38,0:31:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now remove yourself from this ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.28,0:31:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.68,0:31:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me back the cake\Nand I'll be on my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.18,0:31:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Fish and Karate secret out!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.88,0:31:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Magamon Drill!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.50,0:32:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.66,0:32:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.40,0:32:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.74,0:32:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He kicked her off the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.68,0:32:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.40,0:32:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice way!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.78,0:32:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.92,0:32:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't rejoice yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.06,0:32:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Your captain entrusted the ship to us,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.04,0:32:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,so we must ensure it's still\Nstanding when he returns!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.22,0:32:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot allow our\Nguard to rest so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.90,0:32:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, if Perospero catches up to\Nus, then it will truly be the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.98,0:32:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.34,0:32:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A very good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.88,0:32:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We must forge ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.72,0:32:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time before Big\NMom will be on her feet once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.56,0:32:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How's Karen? She's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.64,0:32:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make some distance\Nbetween us and our foes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.06,0:32:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you holding up okay, Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.62,0:32:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.64,0:33:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.58,0:33:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad, Jinbe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.82,0:33:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I warned you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.48,0:33:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that gives me a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.18,0:33:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll slice their ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.16,0:33:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.20,0:33:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It should be easier to\Nfind my cake that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.96,0:33:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.46,0:33:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Her sword is stretching!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.92,0:33:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What if she starts swinging it around?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.00,0:33:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I fear that our\Nship will be done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.48,0:33:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in a much better position\Nwith her off the ship, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.50,0:33:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here, Susie!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.92,0:33:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want some more treats?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.98,0:33:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.74,0:33:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Black ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.62,0:33:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh boy, oh boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.24,0:34:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.74,0:34:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, all for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.84,0:34:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they really? Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.32,0:34:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec, I know that\Nyou're tricking me!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.36,0:34:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be falling for that one\Nagain, foul tempests of evil!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.32,0:34:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Tommy, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.12,0:34:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.03,0:34:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.56,0:34:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.00,0:34:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.46,0:34:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I lack flesh and guts,\Nyour lightning has no effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.74,0:34:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.96,0:34:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure you want to fight me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.44,0:34:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Soul King!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.02,0:34:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,My,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.93,0:34:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,how quickly you forget that your sword\Nfailed to even lay a single scratch on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.12,0:34:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I recall.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.12,0:34:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But might I suggest\Nthat you give me a brief
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.82,0:34:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,glimpse of what an Emperor's\NParis might look like!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.84,0:35:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.96,0:35:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.74,0:35:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Never, you mind, it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.66,0:35:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, three verse humming.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.70,0:35:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Soul nut slash.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.68,0:35:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Our only target was Zeus this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.56,0:35:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Misdirection at its finest.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.38,0:35:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, cut off guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.22,0:35:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull it together, Zeus.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.26,0:35:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Positive charge, black ball, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.22,0:35:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now discharge and you'll feel way better.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.20,0:35:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Zeusy-Foo. Monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.68,0:35:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.70,0:36:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.66,0:36:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.30,0:36:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What did they just pull off?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.66,0:36:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They just slotted Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.72,0:36:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.22,0:36:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It really worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.12,0:36:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll buy us a little time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.92,0:36:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We should take this opportunity\Nto make some headway.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.86,0:36:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry along, Brooke! Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.20,0:36:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.88,0:36:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.02,0:36:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me how much you all miss me!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.96,0:36:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.87,0:36:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back! Nicely done! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.42,0:36:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We tried to minimize the\Ndamage as best we could,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.72,0:37:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,but the sunny still\Ntook quite the beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.36,0:37:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.44,0:37:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I found this on my way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.00,0:37:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Pussy Poo!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.80,0:37:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that guy dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.26,0:37:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I highly doubt he'll\Ncause us any more trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.64,0:37:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a doozy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.44,0:37:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.56,0:37:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, little buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.66,0:37:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.00,0:37:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Zuzy-poo, I've been\Nmeaning to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.86,0:37:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why in the world did you try\Nto electrocute me earlier, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.76,0:37:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.67,0:37:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If sorry fixed everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.46,0:37:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,all of those marines out there\Nwould be out of a job, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.46,0:37:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There must have been a\Nmisconception along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.46,0:37:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,How about I rephrase it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.00,0:37:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't asking to be friends,\Njust so we're on the same page. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.98,0:37:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll state the question once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.96,0:38:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you be my servant?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.70,0:38:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Or will you die?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.36,0:38:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Think it over carefully, cutie.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.86,0:38:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.38,0:38:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.64,0:38:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth! Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.92,0:38:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Prometheus!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.83,0:38:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go after them!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.86,0:38:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on it, Mama!
